{"4038290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Land of Manifestations: Sanctuary", "steam_appid": 4038290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/b6f0cc0bc9353a99f13801fa2f8eca23.avif?t=1788329121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras_big/b6f0cc0bc9353a99f13801fa2f8eca23.webp?t=1788329121 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the links on our X or Discord.</strong></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening in the Temple of Tianwen with no memory of your past, you are told that for the survival of the Land of Manifestations, you must build a sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into roguelite shooting dungeons, bring treasures and rescued companions home, build your Sanctuary, and deepen your relationships with companions. Sanctuary Prosperity and companion support will help you grow stronger for the next run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Explore Roguelite Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong> </strong>roguelite shooting dungeons, fight enemies, and bring treasures home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/5eac9631991fa814d75aa890703b9518.poster.avif?t=1788329121\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/5eac9631991fa814d75aa890703b9518.webm?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/5eac9631991fa814d75aa890703b9518.mp4?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Build your Sanctuary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Prefab Houses acquired during dungeon runs to build your own sanctuary and decorate your room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/1fdebc04236334541e2774350f498ddb.poster.avif?t=1788329121\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/1fdebc04236334541e2774350f498ddb.webm?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/1fdebc04236334541e2774350f498ddb.mp4?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/03942c5c9ebd02eaeea3cebfc98bd6de.poster.avif?t=1788329121\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/03942c5c9ebd02eaeea3cebfc98bd6de.webm?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/03942c5c9ebd02eaeea3cebfc98bd6de.mp4?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Bonds &amp; Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with your companions, go on dates, and gradually uncover their personal stories as your relationships deepen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/7417ff42f16c0d15161a8d43597333a8.poster.avif?t=1788329121\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/7417ff42f16c0d15161a8d43597333a8.webm?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/7417ff42f16c0d15161a8d43597333a8.mp4?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Grow Stronger Through Bonds and Sanctuary Prosperity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, buffs, and companion support as your relationships deepen and your Sanctuary grows. Some companions can even join you in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/3ad512553a3e7d710822d7986a5acc6f.poster.avif?t=1788329121\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/3ad512553a3e7d710822d7986a5acc6f.webm?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038290/extras/3ad512553a3e7d710822d7986a5acc6f.mp4?t=1788329121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening in the Temple of Tianwen with no memory of your past, you are told that for the survival of the Land of Manifestations, you must build a sanctuary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into roguelite shooting dungeons, bring treasures and rescued companions home, build your Sanctuary, and deepen your relationships with companions. Sanctuary Prosperity and companion support will help you grow stronger for the next run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ <strong>Explore Roguelite Realms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong> </strong